window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Dragon King Zythian has been ruling the people of Agantu for one thousand years. Agantu is a planet where dragon-shifters live peacefully side-by-side with non-shifters. Two hundred years ago, he finally started feeling the presence of his mate, only to watch her die helplessly three separate times over the course of those two hundred years. He can feel it in his soul that he won't survive losing her a fourth. This time, he has a shadow dragon-shifter assisting him in searching for her, and after fifty long years of searching after the latest death, Zythian's shadow advisor finds her in a nightclub called Club Aura. This time, he vows to find and protect her before Blight, an anti-shifter organization, can get to her.</p> <p>Valentina is the head manager and co-founder of Club Aura. She'd founded it with three of her friends after recovering from five years in a cage on a different planet. Now she does everything she can to forget those days, but trauma has a way of sneaking back into a person's mind and not letting go. Her world gets thrown into even more chaos when a certain storm dragon-shifter finally finds her, along with Blight.</p>"; 
